  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program Development Objective of the operation is to (i) boost private sector competitiveness by easing market entry and exit; (ii) improve employability and access to quality education; and (iii) enhance energy security and promote climate-smart agriculture.</narrative>
